# @repo/errors ships RAW TypeScript source (package.json "main"/"exports" -> ./src/index.ts).
# It must NEVER be built into src/. Stale compiled .js/.d.ts files here shadow the .ts sources and
# break bundlers (Turbopack resolves `./x.js` to the dead .js: "no exports at all / CommonJs").
# check-types uses `tsc --noEmit`, so these only appear if someone runs a bare `tsc` build - ignore
# and never commit them.
src/*.js
src/*.jsx
src/*.d.ts
src/*.js.map
dist/
